theorem MathScope.P7.ExportedResearch.exportedHypotheses : ∀ (P0 P1 P2 P3 P4 P5 : Prop),
  P0 → P1 → P2 → P3 → P4 → P5 → P0 ∧ P1 ∧ P2 ∧ P3 ∧ P4 ∧ P5 :=
fun P0 P1 P2 P3 P4 P5 h0 h1 h2 h3 h4 h5 => ⟨h0, ⟨h1, ⟨h2, ⟨h3, ⟨h4, h5⟩⟩⟩⟩⟩
'MathScope.P7.ExportedResearch.exportedHypotheses' does not depend on any axioms
